<p><strong>Tracking node values by their column id</strong><br>
Now that we have a way to determine a node=E2=80=99s column, we=E2=80=99ll =
need a way to keep track of which node values belong to which columns. This=
 can be done using a <strong>hash map</strong> where keys are column ids an=
d the value of each column id is a list of the node values at that column.<=
/p>
