<p><strong>Creating the output</strong><br>
This problem expects us to return the column ids from left to right. As we =
know, a hash map does not inherently maintain the order of its keys (column=
 ids), which means we=E2=80=99ll need to find a way to attain the output in=
 the desired order.</p>
<p>To retrieve the column ids in the desired order, it would be useful to k=
